## 2. Agent Profile & Dashboard Data APIs

### 2.1 Get Agent Full Dashboard Data
Fetch complete live profile for an agent, including wallet balance, referral code, list of customers enrolled by this agent, recent collection receipts, and 14-level commission breakdown.

- **Endpoint:** `GET /api/agent/data?agentId=AGT001`
- **Query Parameters:**
  - `agentId` (optional): Agent ID, mobile number, or referral code

#### Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "agent": {
      "agentId": "AGT001",
      "name": "Rakesh Kumar",
      "mobile": "9876543210",
      "email": "rakesh.agent@multicredit.com",
      "branch": "Kolkata HQ",
      "status": "Active",
      "referralCode": "AGT-3601",
      "walletBalance": 18450,
      "totalCommission": 42500,
      "totalDirectCustomers": 24,
      "totalCollection": "₹ 2,50,000",
      "transactions": 120,
      "target": "₹ 3,00,000",
      "achievementRate": 83
    },
    "customers": [
      {
        "customerId": "CUS001",
        "name": "Md. Salim Ansari",
        "accountNumber": "MC360-9876543210",
        "mobile": "9876543210",
        "type": "Loan",
        "savingsBalance": 34500,
        "kycStatus": "Verified",
        "status": "Active"
      },
      {
        "customerId": "CUS005",
        "name": "Anil Das",
        "accountNumber": "MC360-9876543214",
        "mobile": "9876543214",
        "type": "Loan",
        "savingsBalance": 9800,
        "kycStatus": "Verified",
        "status": "Active"
