## 3. Customer Onboarding API (Agent User Create)

### 3.1 Onboard Customer
Allows an authenticated agent to register a new customer with complete documents (PAN Number & Photo, Aadhaar Number & Photo, Address, Pincode, Password). The agent's referral code is automatically linked, and the direct customer onboarding commission (e.g. ₹250) is automatically credited to the agent's wallet.

- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/agent/create-customer`
- **Headers:** `Content-Type: application/json`

#### Request Body:
```json
{
  "agentId": "AGT001",
  "agentReferralCode": "AGT-3601",
  "name": "Kamal Hassan",
  "mobile": "9876543299",
  "email": "kamal@example.com",
  "password": "custpassword123",
  "panNumber": "ABCDE9999K",
  "panImage": "data:image/jpeg;base64,... (or image URL)",
  "adhaarNumber": "5678 1234 9999",
  "adhaarImage": "data:image/jpeg;base64,... (or image URL)",
  "address": "77 MG Road, Kolkata",
  "pincode": "700001",
  "type": "Loan",
  "initialDeposit": 1000
}
```

#### Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Customer onboarded successfully! ₹250 commission credited to agent wallet.",
  "data": {
    "customer": {
      "customerId": "CUS812",
      "name": "Kamal Hassan",
      "mobile": "9876543299",
      "accountNumber": "MC360-9876543299",
      "debitCardNumber": "5421 9876 5432 9926",
      "debitCardExpiry": "09/31",
      "debitCardCvv": "492",
      "savingsBalance": 5000,
      "referralCode": "AGT-3601",
      "agentId": "AGT001",
      "kycStatus": "Verified",
      "status": "Active"
    },
    "commissionEarned": 250
  }
}
```

